From: Abhi Teja Cholleti <abhiteja.cholleti@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: add regulatory, opclass, pureN and band display commands

Add ubus-cli accessible methods to WiFi.Radio.{i}:

  - setCountryId / getCountryId   : set/get country by numeric ID via
                                    cfg80211tool set_country_id / get_country_id
  - countryIe / getCountryIe      : enable/disable Country IE in beacons via
                                    hostapd COUNTRY_IE / GET_COUNTRY_IE
  - opclassTbl / getOpclassTbl    : set/get operating-class table index (0-6)
  - disableOpclassChans           : enable/disable channels per operating class
  - setPureN / getPureN           : enable/disable 802.11n-pure mode
  - displayBandChans              : band-channel info via cfg80211tool
  - displaySuperChanList          : extended channel list (EIRP, flags, AFC)

cfg80211tool phy-level commands resolve the nl80211 phy name from
/sys/class/net/<wlan>/phy80211/name and use radio_idx syntax:
  cfg80211tool phyX radio_idx 0 <cmd> [value]

Signed-off-by: Abhi Teja Cholleti <abhiteja.cholleti@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 odl/wld_radio.odl |  87 +++++++++
 src/wld_radio.c   | 416 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 503 insertions(+)

